/E (This Ordering Guide is provided as a reference to assist government customers in using the Abrahams Consulting SEWP VI contract. It is intended to supplement, but not replace, the applicable terms and conditions of the SEWP VI Contract, the Statement of Work \(SOW\), the Contract Holder User Manual \(CHUM\), the Federal Acquisition Regulation \(FAR\), or agency-specific procurement policies. In the event of any inconsistency, the applicable contract documents and governing regulations shall prevail.  )
